WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.633
Here's one,

00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:10.167
a picture puzzle!

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:12.700
Which shape completes the pattern?

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:13.200
A.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.733
An empty triangle,

00:00:14.733 --> 00:00:15.267
B.

00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:16.800
An empty square,

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:17.300
C.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.833
A filled square,

00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:19.833
or D.

00:00:19.833 --> 00:00:21.367
A filled circle?

00:00:21.367 --> 00:00:22.400
Five seconds!

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.400
TIME'S UP!

00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:31.233
The answer is...

00:00:31.233 --> 00:00:31.633
D,

00:00:31.633 --> 00:00:32.800
a filled circle!

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.167
The rule is the shape gets

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:37.500
filled in but stays the same

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:37.900
shape,

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:40.233
so the empty circle becomes a

00:00:40.233 --> 00:00:41.033
filled circle.

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:42.733
Alright,

00:00:42.733 --> 00:00:44.433
a word analogy!

00:00:44.433 --> 00:00:46.733
Hard is to soft,

00:00:46.733 --> 00:00:49.000
as heavy is to...

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:49.567
what?

00:00:49.567 --> 00:00:50.133
A.

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:50.733
Rock,

00:00:50.733 --> 00:00:51.300
B.

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:51.867
Light,

00:00:51.867 --> 00:00:52.433
C.

00:00:52.433 --> 00:00:53.000
Strong,

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.133
or D.

00:00:54.133 --> 00:00:54.700
Big?

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:55.833
Five seconds!

00:01:01.633 --> 00:01:02.833
TIME'S UP!

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:04.000
It's...

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:04.500
B,

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.033
light!

00:01:05.033 --> 00:01:07.567
Hard and soft are opposites,

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:11.100
so the opposite of heavy is light.

00:01:12.267 --> 00:01:12.900
Okay,

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:14.800
a number series!

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:15.467
Three,

00:01:15.467 --> 00:01:16.100
eleven,

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:16.733
nineteen,

00:01:16.733 --> 00:01:17.367
twenty-seven,

00:01:17.367 --> 00:01:18.633
and then...

00:01:18.633 --> 00:01:20.533
what comes next?

00:01:20.533 --> 00:01:21.167
A.

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:21.800
Thirty-eight,

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:22.467
B.

00:01:22.467 --> 00:01:23.100
Thirty-four,

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:23.733
C.

00:01:23.733 --> 00:01:24.367
Thirty-five,

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:25.633
or D.

00:01:25.633 --> 00:01:26.267
Thirty-three?

00:01:26.267 --> 00:01:27.533
Five seconds!

00:01:33.333 --> 00:01:34.533
TIME'S UP!

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:36.700
The answer is...

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:37.200
C,

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:37.700
thirty-five!

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:40.733
Each number goes up by eight,

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:43.733
so the next one is twenty-seven

00:01:43.733 --> 00:01:45.767
plus eight is thirty-five.

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:47.467
Okay,

00:01:47.467 --> 00:01:49.133
a picture puzzle!

00:01:49.133 --> 00:01:52.500
Where does the dot move next?

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:53.067
A.

00:01:53.067 --> 00:01:53.633
Center,

00:01:53.633 --> 00:01:54.167
B.

00:01:54.167 --> 00:01:54.733
Bottom-right,

00:01:54.733 --> 00:01:55.300
C.

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:55.867
Top-left,

00:01:55.867 --> 00:01:56.967
or D.

00:01:56.967 --> 00:01:57.533
Bottom-left?

00:01:57.533 --> 00:01:58.667
Five seconds!

00:02:04.433 --> 00:02:05.633
TIME'S UP!

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:07.700
The answer is...

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:08.167
D,

00:02:08.167 --> 00:02:08.633
bottom-left!

00:02:08.633 --> 00:02:10.500
The dot steps counter-clockwise

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:11.900
around the corners,

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:14.700
so the next spot is bottom-left.

00:02:15.867 --> 00:02:16.500
Alright!

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:19.700
Which one does NOT belong?

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:20.333
A.

00:02:20.333 --> 00:02:21.000
Spoon,

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:21.633
B.

00:02:21.633 --> 00:02:22.267
Shirt,

00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:22.900
C.

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:23.533
Jacket,

00:02:23.533 --> 00:02:24.833
or D.

00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:25.467
Pants?

00:02:25.467 --> 00:02:26.733
Five seconds!

00:02:32.533 --> 00:02:33.733
TIME'S UP!

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:34.900
It's...

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:35.433
A,

00:02:35.433 --> 00:02:35.933
spoon!

00:02:35.933 --> 00:02:36.933
A shirt,

00:02:36.933 --> 00:02:37.467
pants,

00:02:37.467 --> 00:02:39.500
and jacket are clothing.

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.533
A spoon is not,

00:02:41.533 --> 00:02:44.067
so it does not belong.

00:02:45.233 --> 00:02:46.533
Here's one,

00:02:46.533 --> 00:02:48.500
a number series!

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:49.133
Two,

00:02:49.133 --> 00:02:49.800
six,

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:50.467
eight,

00:02:50.467 --> 00:02:51.100
fourteen,

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:51.767
twenty-two,

00:02:51.767 --> 00:02:53.067
and then...

00:02:53.067 --> 00:02:55.033
what comes next?

00:02:55.033 --> 00:02:55.667
A.

00:02:55.667 --> 00:02:56.333
Thirty-eight,

00:02:56.333 --> 00:02:56.967
B.

00:02:56.967 --> 00:02:57.633
Thirty-six,

00:02:57.633 --> 00:02:58.267
C.

00:02:58.267 --> 00:02:58.933
Thirty-five,

00:02:58.933 --> 00:03:00.233
or D.

00:03:00.233 --> 00:03:00.900
Thirty-one?

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.200
Five seconds!

00:03:07.967 --> 00:03:09.167
TIME'S UP!

00:03:09.833 --> 00:03:11.333
The answer is...

00:03:11.333 --> 00:03:11.833
B,

00:03:11.833 --> 00:03:12.333
thirty-six!

00:03:12.333 --> 00:03:15.333
Add the two numbers before it:

00:03:15.333 --> 00:03:17.833
twenty-two plus fourteen is thirty-six.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.100
Here's one,

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.767
a picture puzzle!

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:25.067
Where does the dot move next?

00:03:25.067 --> 00:03:25.633
A.

00:03:25.633 --> 00:03:26.200
Bottom-right,

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:26.733
B.

00:03:26.733 --> 00:03:27.300
Top-right,

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:27.833
C.

00:03:27.833 --> 00:03:28.400
Bottom-left,

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:29.500
or D.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:30.067
Center?

00:03:30.067 --> 00:03:31.167
Five seconds!

00:03:36.933 --> 00:03:38.133
TIME'S UP!

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:40.100
The answer is...

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:40.533
B,

00:03:40.533 --> 00:03:40.967
top-right!

00:03:40.967 --> 00:03:43.167
The dot steps clockwise around

00:03:43.167 --> 00:03:44.033
the corners,

00:03:44.033 --> 00:03:46.633
so the next spot is top-right.

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:48.467
Alright,

00:03:48.467 --> 00:03:50.467
a number analogy!

00:03:50.467 --> 00:03:52.433
Four makes eleven,

00:03:52.433 --> 00:03:54.433
five makes fourteen,

00:03:54.433 --> 00:03:56.433
six makes seventeen,

00:03:56.433 --> 00:03:58.400
so seven makes...

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.067
what?

00:03:59.067 --> 00:03:59.733
A.

00:03:59.733 --> 00:04:00.400
Twenty,

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:01.067
B.

00:04:01.067 --> 00:04:01.733
Twenty-five,

00:04:01.733 --> 00:04:02.367
C.

00:04:02.367 --> 00:04:03.033
Twenty-two,

00:04:03.033 --> 00:04:04.367
or D.

00:04:04.367 --> 00:04:05.033
Twenty-three?

00:04:05.033 --> 00:04:06.367
Five seconds!

00:04:12.133 --> 00:04:13.333
TIME'S UP!

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:14.500
It's...

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:15.000
A,

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:15.533
twenty!

00:04:15.533 --> 00:04:18.567
Each number is multiplied by three

00:04:18.567 --> 00:04:20.600
then take away one,

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:22.633
so seven becomes twenty.

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:25.167
Check this out,

00:04:25.167 --> 00:04:27.000
fill in the blank!

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:29.733
He could not find his keys

00:04:29.733 --> 00:04:32.467
because his whole room was so

00:04:32.467 --> 00:04:33.833
blank and cluttered.

00:04:33.833 --> 00:04:34.267
A.

00:04:34.267 --> 00:04:34.733
Bright,

00:04:34.733 --> 00:04:35.200
B.

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:35.633
Empty,

00:04:35.633 --> 00:04:36.100
C.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:36.567
Messy,

00:04:36.567 --> 00:04:37.467
or D.

00:04:37.467 --> 00:04:37.933
Clean?

00:04:37.933 --> 00:04:38.833
Five seconds!

00:04:44.633 --> 00:04:45.833
TIME'S UP!

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:47.000
It's...

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:47.500
C,

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:48.000
messy!

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:51.033
Cluttered and hard to search means

00:04:51.033 --> 00:04:53.067
the room was messy.

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:55.267
Here's one,

00:04:55.267 --> 00:04:56.833
a number puzzle,

00:04:56.833 --> 00:04:58.433
and it's sneaky!

00:04:58.433 --> 00:05:01.600
If two plus five makes five,

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:04.233
one plus three makes zero,

00:05:04.233 --> 00:05:06.900
three plus one makes two,

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:09.533
then two plus five makes...

00:05:09.533 --> 00:05:10.067
what?

00:05:10.067 --> 00:05:10.600
A.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:11.133
Seven,

00:05:11.133 --> 00:05:11.633
B.

00:05:11.633 --> 00:05:12.167
Four,

00:05:12.167 --> 00:05:12.700
C.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:13.233
Five,

00:05:13.233 --> 00:05:14.300
or D.

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:14.833
Zero?

00:05:14.833 --> 00:05:15.867
Five seconds!

00:05:21.667 --> 00:05:22.867
TIME'S UP!

00:05:23.533 --> 00:05:24.900
The answer is...

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:25.333
C,

00:05:25.333 --> 00:05:25.800
five!

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.533
The trick is to multiply them,

00:05:28.533 --> 00:05:30.800
then take away the second:

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:33.067
ten minus five is five.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:34.600
So,

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.633
are you smart or fart?

00:05:36.633 --> 00:05:39.067
Count up your correct answers to

00:05:39.067 --> 00:05:40.267
find your rank!

00:05:41.433 --> 00:05:41.800
So,

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:43.233
how did you do?

00:05:43.233 --> 00:05:44.700
Comment your score below,

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:46.167
and subscribe for more!
